{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地有「最美黃蓉」之稱的李一桐，雖搭檔內地男神李現合拍劇集《我不是大師》有口好碑，但她依然傳遭內地電視台杧果台「嫌棄」，令李一桐的粉絲嬲爆。</p><p>李一桐本是內地綜藝節目《女子推理社》第1及2季的常駐嘉賓，而在第3季錄製前，有傳她遭電視台「踢」出新</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.229412+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T03:01:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"47df4a96e7d683a9f0d40403488fcb0b4edc04027a97133b6133a8e3bfea890b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}